# Preaching schedule initials (or names) → full speaker name with title.
# ------------------------------------
# The schedule's Preacher columns usually hold initials ("JW") or a surname.
# Each row here maps one of those to the name used in the documents.
#
# FORMAT:
#   initials,full_name
#   - Matching ignores upper/lower case, spaces and punctuation,
#     so "jw", "JW", "J W" and "JW?" all match the row "jw".
#   - Add a row for each spelling the schedule uses (initials, surname,
#     full name) if they differ.
#   - Lines starting with # are comments and are ignored.
#
initials,full_name
jw,Pastor Joel E. Wood
jew,Pastor Joel E. Wood
joel wood,Pastor Joel E. Wood
cu,Pastor Connor Underseth
ap,Intern Aaron Phillip
jm,Pastor Jim Megchelsen
ml,Intern Morgan Loughlean
no,Intern Nicholas Okada
ld,Ligon Duncan
ligon duncan,Ligon Duncan
ray call,Ray Call
rc,Ray Call
billingslea,David Billingslea
db,David Billingslea
david billingslea,David Billingslea
david zadok,David Zadok
dz,David Zadok
greg beale,Greg Beale
